      <main>
        <header class="page-intro">
          <p class="eyebrow">Lab / directory</p>
          <h1>Experience, observe,<br>verify, explore.</h1>
          <p class="lede">The Lab is the technical workspace of Atlas Systems. Ramone remains the flagship; every other destination now carries a visual signature tied to its actual operation.</p>
        </header>
    
        <section class="ramone-stage" aria-labelledby="ramone-greet">
          <div class="ramone-hero">
            <div class="ramone-card awake" id="ramone-card">
              <div class="ramone-hero-topbar">
                <div class="ramone-lights"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
                <div class="ramone-hero-sysinfo"><strong>atlas-systems</strong><span class="rh-sep">//</span><strong>ramone</strong></div>
                <div class="ramone-hero-live"><span class="ramone-dot"></span><span id="ramone-state-label">connecting</span></div>
              </div>
              <div class="ramone-hero-center">
                <div class="ramone-boot" id="ramone-boot" aria-hidden="true"></div>
                <h2 class="ramone-hero-heading is-pre" id="ramone-greet">Hi, I'm <em>Ramone.</em><span class="ramone-caret"></span></h2>
                <p class="ramone-musing" id="ramone-musing"><span class="ramone-musing-cursor"></span></p>
                <div class="ramone-hero-composer" id="ramone-hero-composer">
                  <div class="ramone-hero-composer-prompt"><span class="blip">▍</span> ask ramone</div>
                  <div class="ramone-input-wrap"><span class="ps1">&gt;</span><textarea id="ramone-mini-input" class="ramone-hero-input" rows="1" maxlength="2000" aria-label="Ask Ramone a question" placeholder="type a question and press enter, or shift+enter for a new line"></textarea></div>
                  <div class="ramone-hero-composer-actions"><span class="ramone-hero-char-count" id="ramone-hero-char-count">0 / 2000</span><button class="ramone-hero-reset" id="ramone-mini-reset" type="button">new conversation</button><button class="ramone-hero-send" id="ramone-mini-send" type="button" disabled>transmit</button></div>
                </div>
                <div class="ramone-hero-suggestions" id="ramone-hero-suggestions"><span class="ramone-hero-suggestions-label">or poke me with</span><button class="ramone-hero-chip" type="button">What are you running on?</button><button class="ramone-hero-chip" type="button">Show me something you built</button><button class="ramone-hero-chip" type="button">Do you ever get bored?</button><button class="ramone-hero-chip" type="button">What's the weirdest thing in your docs?</button></div>
                <div class="ramone-hero-answer" id="ramone-mini-answer" hidden><div class="ramone-mini-answer-text" id="ramone-mini-answer-text"></div><div class="ramone-mini-sources" id="ramone-mini-sources"></div><div class="ramone-mini-meta" id="ramone-mini-meta"></div></div>
              </div>
              <div class="ramone-hero-footer"><span>built &amp; maintained by atlas reaper</span><a class="ramone-hero-link" href="https://ramone.atlas-systems.uk/">open full interface →</a></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
    
        <aside class="interface-legend" aria-labelledby="lab-legend-title">
          <div class="interface-legend__intro">
            <p class="eyebrow">Reading the Lab</p>
            <h2 id="lab-legend-title">Commitment and data are separate.</h2>
            <p>A maturity label describes the interface contract. A data label describes what the experience is using now. Neither is a runtime-health claim.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="interface-legend__columns">
            <div class="legend-panel">
              <h3>Maturity</h3>
              <dl class="legend-list">
                <div><dt><span class="badge production">Production</span></dt><dd>Stable public product or surface.</dd></div>
                <div><dt><span class="badge tool">Tool</span></dt><dd>Focused engineering utility.</dd></div>
                <div><dt><span class="badge preview">Preview</span></dt><dd>Usable interface with a contract still being refined.</dd></div>
                <div><dt><span class="badge experiment">Experiment</span></dt><dd>Exploratory behaviour without a stable product contract.</dd></div>
                <div><dt><span class="badge planned">Planned</span></dt><dd>Declared future work that is not yet a usable public surface.</dd></div>
                <div><dt><span class="badge retired">Retired</span></dt><dd>Historical surface that is no longer an active public destination.</dd></div>
              </dl>
            </div>
            <div class="legend-panel">
              <h3>Data mode</h3>
              <dl class="legend-list legend-list--data">
                <div><dt><span class="mode-key" data-mode-key="live">Live</span></dt><dd>Current bounded public evidence.</dd></div>
                <div><dt><span class="mode-key" data-mode-key="replay">Replay</span></dt><dd>Captured evidence played back.</dd></div>
                <div><dt><span class="mode-key" data-mode-key="generated">Generated</span></dt><dd>Output produced in the browser or engine now.</dd></div>
                <div><dt><span class="mode-key" data-mode-key="simulated">Simulated</span></dt><dd>Explicit non-live scenario data.</dd></div>
              </dl>
            </div>
          </div>
        </aside>
    
        <section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="featured-title">
          <div class="section-head">
            <div><p class="eyebrow">Featured tools</p><h2 id="featured-title">Four distinct ways into the estate.</h2></div>
            <p>Each specimen reflects the system behind it. System SYMPHONY remains a Preview until its later audio and interaction pass.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card-grid featured-grid">
            <a id="system-map" class="system-card specimen-card specimen-card--primary featured atlas-anchor-target" data-family="observe" data-visual="map" data-motif="TOPO" href="/lab/system-map/">
              <div class="card-top"><span class="type-label">Architecture evidence</span><span class="badge tool">Tool</span></div>
              <h3>System Map</h3>
              <p>Declared public architecture enriched by live registry evidence, with a dedicated canvas and its full legend.</p>
              <span class="data-mode">Live data</span><span class="card-route">Open map →</span>
            </a>
            <a class="system-card specimen-card" data-family="verify" data-visual="proof" data-motif="TRACE" href="/lab/proof-chain/">
              <div class="card-top"><span class="type-label">Trace evidence</span><span class="badge tool">Tool</span></div>
              <h3>Proof Chain</h3>
              <p>Source repository, service, and accepted governance proof through the bounded public Trace contract.</p>
              <span class="data-mode">Live data</span><span class="card-route">Open proof →</span>
            </a>
            <a class="system-card specimen-card" data-family="experience" data-visual="signal" data-motif="DSP" href="/lab/signal/">
              <div class="card-top"><span class="type-label">Generative DSP</span><span class="badge experiment">Experiment</span></div>
              <h3>Signal Garden</h3>
              <p>A browser-native AudioWorklet instrument with autonomous and performance modes.</p>
              <span class="data-mode">Generated live audio</span><span class="card-route">Open instrument →</span>
            </a>
            <a class="system-card specimen-card" data-family="experience" data-visual="symphony" data-motif="WAVE" href="/lab/console/">
              <div class="card-top"><span class="type-label">Telemetry sonification</span><span class="badge preview">Preview</span></div>
              <h3>System SYMPHONY</h3>
              <p>The current live telemetry score remains available inside the detailed operations console.</p>
              <span class="data-mode">Preview · live data</span><span class="card-route">Open console →</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </section>
    
        <section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="directory-title">
          <div class="section-head">
            <div><p class="eyebrow">Lab directory</p><h2 id="directory-title">Grouped by purpose.</h2></div>
            <p>Maturity says what kind of commitment a surface has. The visual motif says what kind of system it is. Neither replaces operational truth.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="group-stack">
            <div class="group-block" data-family="experience">
              <div class="group-label">Experience</div>
              <div class="card-grid directory-grid">
                <a class="system-card directory-card" data-family="experience" data-visual="ramone" data-motif="RAG" href="https://ramone.atlas-systems.uk/">
                  <div class="card-top"><span class="type-label">Grounded local AI</span><span class="badge production">Production</span></div>
                  <h3>Ramone</h3><p>The full public conversational interface.</p><span class="card-route">Open product →</span>
                </a>
                <a class="system-card directory-card" data-family="experience" data-visual="symphony" data-motif="WAVE" href="/lab/console/">
                  <div class="card-top"><span class="type-label">Telemetry music</span><span class="badge preview">Preview</span></div>
                  <h3>System SYMPHONY</h3><p>Live estate telemetry translated into a bounded musical state.</p>
                  <span class="data-mode">Live data</span><span class="card-route">Open console →</span>
                </a>
                <a class="system-card directory-card" data-family="experience" data-visual="signal" data-motif="DSP" href="/lab/signal/">
                  <div class="card-top"><span class="type-label">Audio DSP</span><span class="badge experiment">Experiment</span></div>
                  <h3>Signal Garden</h3><p>Interactive granular synthesis and long-form generative sound.</p>
                  <span class="data-mode">Generated live audio</span><span class="card-route">Open instrument →</span>
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
    
            <div class="group-block" data-family="observe">
              <div class="group-label">Observe</div>
              <div class="card-grid directory-grid">
                <a class="system-card directory-card" data-family="observe" data-visual="map" data-motif="TOPO" href="/lab/system-map/">
                  <div class="card-top"><span class="type-label">Architecture</span><span class="badge tool">Tool</span></div>
                  <h3>System Map</h3><p>Public topology and observed registry state.</p><span class="card-route">Open map →</span>
                </a>
                <a class="system-card directory-card" data-family="observe" data-visual="status" data-motif="SLO" href="https://status.atlas-systems.uk/">
                  <div class="card-top"><span class="type-label">Reliability</span><span class="badge production">Production</span></div>
                  <h3>Status</h3><p>Overall condition, service evidence, freshness, and recent events.</p><span class="card-route">View status →</span>
                </a>
                <a id="pipeline-grid-section" class="system-card directory-card atlas-anchor-target" data-family="observe" data-visual="console" data-motif="OPS" href="/lab/console/">
                  <div class="card-top"><span class="type-label">Operations</span><span class="badge tool">Tool</span></div>
                  <h3>Detailed Console</h3><p>Activity, deployment evidence, DORA metrics, API summary, and the full operations rail.</p><span class="card-route">Open console →</span>
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
    
            <div class="group-block" data-family="verify">
              <div class="group-label">Verify</div>
              <div class="card-grid directory-grid verify-grid">
                <a class="system-card directory-card" data-family="verify" data-visual="proof" data-motif="TRACE" href="/lab/proof-chain/">
                  <div class="card-top"><span class="type-label">Trace</span><span class="badge tool">Tool</span></div>
                  <h3>Proof Chain</h3><p>Source and governance proof for public services.</p><span class="card-route">Open proof →</span>
                </a>
                <a class="system-card directory-card" data-family="verify" data-visual="conformance" data-motif="POLICY" href="/lab/conformance/">
                  <div class="card-top"><span class="type-label">Policy</span><span class="badge tool">Tool</span></div>
                  <h3>Estate Conformance</h3><p>Weighted rule coverage and repository findings.</p><span class="card-route">Open conformance →</span>
                </a>
                <a class="system-card directory-card" data-family="verify" data-visual="reliability" data-motif="RECOVER" href="/lab/reliability/">
                  <div class="card-top"><span class="type-label">Recovery</span><span class="badge tool">Tool</span></div>
                  <h3>Reliability Trials</h3><p>Fault injection, detection, notification, and recovery evidence.</p><span class="card-route">Open trials →</span>
                </a>
                <a class="system-card directory-card" data-family="verify" data-visual="api" data-motif="OPENAPI" href="https://api.atlas-systems.uk/v1/docs">
                  <div class="card-top"><span class="type-label">OpenAPI</span><span class="badge tool">Tool</span></div>
                  <h3>API Docs</h3><p>The human-readable public machine contract.</p><span class="card-route">Open docs →</span>
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
    
            <div class="group-block" data-family="explore">
              <div class="group-label">Explore</div>
              <div class="card-grid directory-grid explore-grid">
                <a class="system-card directory-card directory-card--wide" data-family="explore" data-visual="anomaly" data-motif="DTW" href="/lab/anomaly/">
                  <div class="card-top"><span class="type-label">Telemetry analysis</span><span class="badge experiment">Experiment</span></div>
                  <h3>Shape Detector</h3>
                  <p>Feature extraction, constrained DTW, and temporal decoding against recorded telemetry.</p>
                  <span class="data-mode">Recorded replay</span><span class="card-route">Open detector →</span>
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
    
        <section class="content-section">
          <div id="blackbox" class="console-callout atlas-anchor-target">
            <div><strong>Need the original dense operational view?</strong><p>The full console is preserved as a no-index technical route while its individual evidence panels move into clearer destinations.</p></div>
            <a class="action" href="/lab/console/">Open detailed console</a>
          </div>
        </section>
      </main>
